{"task_id": "HumanEval/3", "solution": "```python\nfrom typing import List\n\ndef below_zero(operations: List[int]) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Detects whether a bank account balance, starting at zero, falls below zero\n    at any point after a series of deposit and withdrawal operations.\n\n    Args:\n        operations: A list of integers representing financial operations.\n                    Positive values are deposits, negative values are withdrawals.\n\n    Returns:\n        True if the balance ever drops below zero, False otherwise.\n\n    Examples:\n        >>> below_zero([10, -5, -3, 4])\n        False\n        >>> below_zero([1, 2, -4, 5])\n        True\n        >>> below_zero([-1, 2, 3])\n        True\n        >>> below_zero([])\n        False\n        >>> below_zero([5])\n        False\n        >>> below_zero([-5])\n        True\n        >>> below_zero([5, -2, -3])\n        False\n        >>> below_zero([10, -20, 10])\n        True\n    \"\"\"\n    current_balance = 0\n    for op in operations:\n        current_balance += op\n        if current_balance < 0:\n            return True\n    return False\n```"}
{"task_id": "HumanEval/3", "solution": "```python\nfrom typing import List\n\ndef below_zero(operations: List[int]) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Detects if a bank account balance falls below zero at any point given a list of operations.\n    :param operations: A list of integers representing deposits (positive) and withdrawals (negative).\n    :return: True if the balance falls below zero at any point, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    current_balance = 0  # REQ-001: Initialize account balance to 0\n\n    # REQ-002: Iterate through each operation in the operations list in the given order\n    for operation in operations:\n        # REQ-003: Update the balance by adding the operation value to it\n        current_balance += operation\n\n        # REQ-004: After each update, check if the balance is less than 0\n        # REQ-005: If at any point the balance is found to be less than 0, immediately return True\n        if current_balance < 0:\n            return True\n\n    # REQ-006: If the system completes iterating through all operations\n    # without the balance ever falling below zero, return False\n    return False\n```"}
