{"task_id": "HumanEval/7", "solution": "```python\nfrom typing import List\n\ndef filter_by_substring(strings: List[str], substring: str) -> List[str]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Filters an input list of strings, returning only those that contain the given substring.\n\n    Args:\n        strings (List[str]): The list of strings to filter.\n        substring (str): The substring to search for within each string.\n\n    Returns:\n        List[str]: A new list containing strings from the input list that\n                   include the substring, preserving their original order.\n\n    Examples:\n        >>> filter_by_substring([], 'a')\n        []\n        >>> filter_by_substring(['abc', 'bacd', 'cde', 'array'], 'a')\n        ['abc', 'bacd', 'array']\n        >>> filter_by_substring(['apple', 'banana', 'cherry'], 'z')\n        []\n        >>> filter_by_substring(['test', 'text'], '')\n        ['test', 'text']\n    \"\"\"\n    filtered_results = []\n    for s in strings:\n        if substring in s:\n            filtered_results.append(s)\n    return filtered_results\n```"}
{"task_id": "HumanEval/7", "solution": "```python\ndef filter_by_substring(string_list: list[str], substring: str) -> list[str]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Filters a list of strings, returning only those that contain a specified substring.\n\n    The substring containment check is case-sensitive.\n\n    Args:\n        string_list: A list of strings to be filtered.\n        substring: The substring to search for within each string.\n\n    Returns:\n        A new list containing strings from string_list that contain the substring.\n        Returns an empty list if no strings match or if the input string_list is empty.\n    \"\"\"\n    result_list = []\n    for item_string in string_list:\n        if substring in item_string:\n            result_list.append(item_string)\n    return result_list\n```"}
