{"task_id": "HumanEval/14", "solution": "```python\ndef all_prefixes(input_string: str) -> list[str]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Generates a list of all prefixes of the input string, ordered from shortest to longest.\n\n    Args:\n        input_string: The source string for which prefixes are to be generated.\n\n    Returns:\n        A list of strings, where each element is a prefix of input_string.\n    \"\"\"\n    prefixes_list: list[str] = []\n    N = len(input_string)\n    for i in range(1, N + 1):\n        # Python slice input_string[:i] extracts characters from index 0 up to (but not including) i.\n        # This naturally generates prefixes from length 1 up to N.\n        prefix = input_string[:i]\n        prefixes_list.append(prefix)\n    return prefixes_list\n```"}
